{"id":"1252c388e907bf3d","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-kw-depth.md","title":"Karchmer-Wigderson Exact Depth Characterization","display":"thm-kw-depth — Karchmer-Wigderson Exact Depth Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-kw-depth","aliases":["28-thm-kw-depth"],"display":"thm-kw-depth — Karchmer-Wigderson Exact Depth Characterization","depends_on":["[[28-df-kw-relation]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 14.16 and proof","source_printed_pages":"303","source_pdf_pages":"329","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-kw-depth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-kw-depth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kw-depth — Karchmer-Wigderson Exact Depth Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c2b52ae52bf94f2\" href=\"?note=1c2b52ae52bf94f2\" title=\"28-df-kw-relation\">28-df-kw-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 14.16 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"303"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"329"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 非常，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathrm{KW}}(f)\">\\(C_{\\mathrm{KW}}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c2b52ae52bf94f2\" href=\"?note=1c2b52ae52bf94f2\" title=\"28-df-kw-relation\">28-df-kw-relation</a>。</li>\n<li>下式使用互异构造标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+,−,\\land,\\lor\">\\(+,−,\\land,\\lor\\)</span> 定义有限否定范式公式树及其值、深度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"−\">\\(−\\)</span> 标签分别表示正、负文字，内节点具有有序的两个子树。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；求值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}(F,x)\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}(F,x)\\)</span> 仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathcal B_n\">\\(F\\in\\mathcal B_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span> 定义，深度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dep}(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{dep}(F)\\)</span> 仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathcal B_n\">\\(F\\in\\mathcal B_n\\)</span> 定义；递归式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span> 为相应直接子树。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{n,0}\\coloneqq\\{(+,i),(−,i):i\\in[n]\\},\\qquad\\mathcal B_{n,t+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal B_{n,t}\\cup\\{(\\circ,F,G):\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\},\\ F,G\\in\\mathcal B_{n,t}\\},\\qquad\\mathcal B_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal B_{n,t}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B_{n,0}\\coloneqq\\{(+,i),(−,i):i\\in[n]\\},\\qquad\\mathcal B_{n,t+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal B_{n,t}\\cup\\{(\\circ,F,G):\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\},\\ F,G\\in\\mathcal B_{n,t}\\},\\qquad\\mathcal B_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal B_{n,t}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}((+,i),x)\\coloneqq x_i,\\quad\\operatorname{ev}((−,i),x)\\coloneqq1-x_i,\\quad\\operatorname{ev}((\\circ,F,G),x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}(F,x)\\circ\\operatorname{ev}(G,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ev}((+,i),x)\\coloneqq x_i,\\quad\\operatorname{ev}((−,i),x)\\coloneqq1-x_i,\\quad\\operatorname{ev}((\\circ,F,G),x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}(F,x)\\circ\\operatorname{ev}(G,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dep}((+,i))\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{dep}((−,i))\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{dep}((\\circ,F,G))\\coloneqq1+\\max\\{\\operatorname{dep}(F),\\operatorname{dep}(G)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dep}((+,i))\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{dep}((−,i))\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{dep}((\\circ,F,G))\\coloneqq1+\\max\\{\\operatorname{dep}(F),\\operatorname{dep}(G)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathrm{KW}}(f)=\\min\\{\\operatorname{dep}(F):F\\in\\mathcal B_n,\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{ev}(F,x)=f(x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_{\\mathrm{KW}}(f)=\\min\\{\\operatorname{dep}(F):F\\in\\mathcal B_n,\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{ev}(F,x)=f(x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从公式根开始维护ZERO取0而ONE取1的节点；OR由ONE选值1子节点，AND由ZERO选值0子节点，每层1比特，叶给不同坐标。反向先剪去到达输入矩形为空的分支，并把只有一个可达子节点的内节点压缩；这不增加协议深度。剩余每叶的两个输入集A、B均非空，输出坐标上所有x_i与y_i不同才强制一个统一方向的文字。再对协议树归纳构造分离零输入A与一输入B的公式：ZERO分支合取两子公式，ONE分支析取。由此得到公式深度不超过原协议深度；与正向不等式合并得到最优深度相等。二叉电路展开为公式不改深度，故等式亦对应教材的电路表述。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 14.16 and proof；印刷页 303；PDF 页 329。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第14章的 Karchmer-Wigderson Exact Depth Characterization，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-kw-relation","status":"resolved","id":"1c2b52ae52bf94f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-kw-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-kw-relation","status":"resolved","id":"1c2b52ae52bf94f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 非常，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$C_{\\mathrm{KW}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-kw-relation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\mathrm{KW}}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"+,−,\\land,\\lor","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"−","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}(F,x)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dep}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"F,G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{n,0}\\coloneqq\\{(+,i),(−,i):i\\in[n]\\},\\qquad\\mathcal B_{n,t+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal B_{n,t}\\cup\\{(\\circ,F,G):\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\},\\ F,G\\in\\mathcal B_{n,t}\\},\\qquad\\mathcal B_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal B_{n,t}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}((+,i),x)\\coloneqq x_i,\\quad\\operatorname{ev}((−,i),x)\\coloneqq1-x_i,\\quad\\operatorname{ev}((\\circ,F,G),x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}(F,x)\\circ\\operatorname{ev}(G,x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dep}((+,i))\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{dep}((−,i))\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{dep}((\\circ,F,G))\\coloneqq1+\\max\\{\\operatorname{dep}(F),\\operatorname{dep}(G)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"C_{\\mathrm{KW}}(f)=\\min\\{\\operatorname{dep}(F):F\\in\\mathcal B_n,\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{ev}(F,x)=f(x)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2993,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-350","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-mod-m-circuit]]、[[28-thm-razborov-smolensky]]、[[28-df-monotone-circuit]]、[[28-df-kw-relation]]、[[28-thm-kw-depth]]。"}],"outgoing":["1c2b52ae52bf94f2"]}